# Domains

- Pure product logic only — no Next.js route handlers, no React components.
- Export from `src/index.ts`. Keep modules named for behavior.
- Add `*.test.ts` beside non-trivial logic.
- Apps import `@voxdeck/<domain>`; do not duplicate types into app-local copies when a domain export exists.
